	(text "RS-232 ports 1 and 2 (UART2, UART3): ST3232B, 3.3 V, +-15 kV ESD on the bus pins, not isolated\n(decided 2026-10-09). 3-wire: DB9 2 RXD (in), 3 TXD (out), 5 GND (DTE, male DB9 on the adapter).\nNo handshake lines: a device that needs them gets them looped in its cable."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
